  catalog     List playgrounds from the catalog, optionally filtering by type
  create      Create a new playground from a base and a manifest file
  destroy     Destroy an active or stopped playground session, completely deleting its data
  lifetime    Show or set a playground's lifetime - the total session duration counted from the playground's start (e.g., 90m, 3h, 2h30m)
  list        List recent playground sessions
  machine     Operate on a single machine of a playground session
  machines    List machines of a specific playground session
  manifest    View playground manifest
  persist     Makes an active playground session persistent
  region      Show or set your preferred region for new playgrounds (one of: eu, ap)
  remove      Remove a playground you authored
  restart     Restart a stopped playground session, resuming its state
  start       Start a new playground session, possibly opening it in a browser
  status      Show the status of a playground session
  stop        Stop a running playground session, preserving its state for future use
  tasks       List tasks of a playground session
  update      Update an existing playground from a manifest file
  wait        Wait until a playground's tasks are completed

